.stylus-content
  width: 53.125em !important

// Every button on the welcome screens is the extra-large control size
// (CONTROL_HEIGHT_XL, button.styl) — the same 34px as the form fields, so a
// "Choose" button is exactly the height of the field it sits beside, and the
// start options, Back and Record share one height with them.  The markup says
// `sm`, the size those buttons use elsewhere; the welcome screens raise them
// here, as the caption bar raises its own controls to large (menu_bar.styl).
//
// Corners are the fields' 6px (`.ct-input-form`), so a button and the field it
// sits beside have matching corners.  `!important` only to beat the app-wide
// `button` radius (0.5em, itself `!important`), which gave these 8px.
.welcome-screen-wrapper [class*="ct-button-"]:not([class*="ct-button-image-"])
  height: CONTROL_HEIGHT_XL
  padding: 0 0.875em
  align-items: center
  border-radius: 0.375rem !important
